{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fa9e2287d23e2ee8c474040d6faf5955515655e4505975e8eebdf9800d80f3a3", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\n伊織と休日の学校にやってきた）", "zh": "（今天为了写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的拍摄，\n我跟伊织一起在假日来到学校。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "21ded3a7158e91822a4376197b262948cfd5296ef553485d1198303cb5d54bc8", "ja": "あ、やっと見つけたわ。プロデューサーのクセに\nアイドルのそばを離れて、何してたのよ？", "zh": "啊，终于找到你了。身为制作人，\n居然没守在偶像身旁，你到底做什么去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d2d81e9c2d4f26cb571967442401fd51baaa8b6c8ebdf600a64be4fbdcd7a125", "ja": "ああ、ごめんごめん。\nちょっと、編集さんと打ち合わせしてたんだ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉。\n我刚刚在和编辑讨论一些事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "a8e3c825c15cf2de0d3b6b6864f0293fdde72156a7dd5acdb9644732d761c5fd", "ja": "ふーん……。ま、いいわ。それより、何か言うことは\nないかしら？　撮影用の衣装に着替えたんだけど？", "zh": "是喔……好吧，那就算了。话说回来，你是不是\n该对我说些什么？我都换上拍摄的服装了耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "262c27f98a1a67040306aae01cc33b97b9c627951aab9cbbf11ed5392f144c47", "ja": "おお、可愛いじゃないか！\n制服姿、すごく似合ってるぞ。", "zh": "喔喔，真是可爱得不得了！\n这身制服打扮非常适合你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "4307e7256bc4a2f0606e1fcd5652945e2f4e5fe5d8a5ee68eef5be78bb08a7b4", "ja": "にひひっ♪　まあ、当然よね！　スーパーアイドル\n伊織ちゃんは、どんな衣装も着こなしちゃうんだから♪", "zh": "咿嘻嘻♪这还用说！\n我这个超级偶像伊织可是能驾驭任何服装的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "c459296ccebfe9becfe7f13f14d39d0e07e6cdd49960af87a14134323b95fed4", "ja": "それにこの制服、デザインも気に入ったわ。\nこれ、今回の企画のために作ってもらったんでしょ？", "zh": "而且我也很喜欢这套制服的设计。\n这是为了这次的企划特别做的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5ec909672a23fa5e8c15982cec7b3285e69cb9ab2c8be145ebe1afae516b3ee9", "ja": "そう、伊織たちの魅力を引き出すために、特別に\n作ってもらったんだ。気に入ってもらえてよかったよ。", "zh": "没错，这是我为了衬托出伊织你们的魅力，\n特别订制的，你能喜欢真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "c8584e893a99ec5e947a37ae74503cc97676ff578dbfaa95d7f5c75fee4f1744", "ja": "……そうだわ！　この際だから、私たちのための\n学校も作っちゃいなさいよ♪", "zh": "……对了！既然如此，\n干脆也帮我们量身打造一所学校吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9bb4b7ed909ddc4e9107b4a1c6cf6b85d27e8a7f06dbe920a1e3c1a057c7e64d", "ja": "伊織たちのための学校？\nそれは、どんな学校なんだ？", "zh": "为伊织你们量身打造学校？\n是指什么样的学校呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "a19aa8ac6596f1f516a9c39eab44e54be6a9fffa61f9d7f72bbb1f32354af4c2", "ja": "そうねえ。アイドルに必要な知識や技術を\n専門で教えてくれる学校かしら。", "zh": "这个嘛，应该是专门教偶像必备知识、技术的学校吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "a6b570a4f0950a73897342de5a5ae582fd13591c3752de34b83ffb221e26db47", "ja": "芸能系の科目を増やして、アイドル活動にも\n単位を出すの。うん、なかなか名案じゃない？", "zh": "增设演艺类科目，从事偶像活动也能拿到学分。\n嗯，你不觉得这是个好点子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bde653f78ffa239d6493cb526b86f1116c9755767ed83e0d8ec4d291380651d8", "ja": "はは、そうだな。みんながそこに通ってくれたら、\n送り迎えも一度で済むから、俺も助かるし。", "zh": "哈哈，也是。大家都在那里上学的话，\n我接人也只要跑一趟就好，省事多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "d84214ae335ff128e5247186b1e600df7fb8df4d28fe304957d7b3465132fcad", "ja": "なによ、その安直な理由は～。でも、みんなで同じ学校\nに通うのは、悪くないわよね。退屈しなさそうだし♪", "zh": "这理由太随便了吧～不过，跟大家一起\n读同一所学校确实不错，感觉一点也不会无聊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1b6ca9774a9db8f633fd7c03d1b935cac9925c2b60818f9af74ad7f0d4803813", "ja": "ああ、にぎやかでいいと思うけど……でも、\n楽しすぎて勉強に身が入らないかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "对啊，我也觉得那样热闹很好……\n但你们说不定会玩过头，反而无法专心念书呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "707c47dd0fa1005918b7ee33f918dae7d72e096b178cdca2d3c9568b00ffdc35", "ja": "あら、そこは、\nアンタがちゃんと管理するべき所じゃない。", "zh": "哎呀，这不就是\n你该负责监督管理的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e240e0942ed3740259b50fbd939d51cdc49bdd071b950dbd54a7440af327158f", "ja": "俺が？　……ああ、なるほど。\nじゃあ俺は、アイドルの学校の先生って事だな。", "zh": "我？……啊，我懂了。\n所以我是偶像学校的老师啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "fd1bb7bd0e5627e20a6d8122d251965b920a2203a0d7600a6d31ad34003a435c", "ja": "なに言ってるの？\nアンタはプロデューサーでしょ？", "zh": "你在胡说什么？\n你当然还是制作人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d7df01acd4c6f974c2816adf85b6dde4442f10f114553b92d0c515fd951b30c6", "ja": "え？　俺は変わらないのか？", "zh": "咦？我的角色没变吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "7f94b0ede36098ce0fb6a6bf7405ad9e2f7fe90aa7082860cfa1537ff1a6d806", "ja": "当たり前じゃない。アンタは、今までもこれからも、\nずーっと私のために働くのっ。", "zh": "这还用说，不论过去或未来，\n你都注定要为我而努力工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0113_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "230c8f3eaaeb1bc2d12a2492b26f4130a11c394e1d28e0ea607b0d69b847e72b", "ja": "さあ、そろそろ撮影を始めてもらいましょ。\n今度はちゃんと、そばにいなさいよねっ！", "zh": "好了，差不多该请工作人员开始拍摄了。\n你这次可要好好陪在我身边喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
